---
description: Go boundaries, errors and tests
globs: "**/*.go"
alwaysApply: false
---
Follow CONTRIBUTING.md and docs/architecture.md.
Use gofmt, descriptive identifiers, explicit errors and propagated contexts.
One translation service serves every entry point.
Keep native code in platform-specific files and SQLite behind storage.
Never silently retry billing, log secrets/text, or ignore persistence failures.
Test consequential error paths with mocks rather than paid or native side effects.
